{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12957","headline":"题思禅寺上方 · 独孤及","name":"题思禅寺上方","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"溪口闻法鼓，停桡登翠屏。\n攀云到金界，合掌开禅扃。\n郁律衆山抱，空蒙花雨零。\n老僧指香楼，云是不死庭。\n眇眇于越路，茫茫春草青。\n远山喷百谷，缭绕驰东溟。\n目极道何在，境照心亦冥。\n騞然诸根空，破结如破瓶。\n下视三界狭，但闻五浊腥。\n山中有良药，吾欲隳天形。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12957.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12957","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}